    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Conerney Estate Agents are delighted to present to market this superb home on Loreto Avenue, ideally positioned in one of Rathfarnham’s most mature and sought-after residential locations.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the property has been exceptionally well maintained by its current owners and has recently been freshly painted, creating a bright, welcoming home that is ready for its new owners to move straight into.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of this property is the beautifully landscaped, south-facing rear garden, which enjoys excellent privacy and is not overlooked. Complementing the garden is a substantial two-room wooden cabin complete with its own bathroom and electric shower. This is a fantastic addition to the property and offers enormous versatility, whether used as a home office, studio, gym, additional living accommodation or other potential use, subject to any necessary permissions.\r\n\r\nInternally, the accommodation is bright, comfortable and well proportioned. To the front is a warm and inviting sitting room, flooded with natural light through the large window. Wooden flooring and a wood-burning stove create a particularly cosy atmosphere, making this a wonderful space in which to relax.\r\n\r\nThe sitting room leads through to the kitchen and dining area at the rear of the property. This is a bright and practical space overlooking the rear garden, with tiled flooring, ample high and low-level kitchen units and plenty of room for dining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms, both benefiting from built-in wardrobes and offering excellent accommodation. The main bathroom is fully tiled and fitted with a bath and shower.\r\n\r\nOutside, the south-facing rear garden is a real highlight. Beautifully landscaped with mature planting and trees, it provides a peaceful and private outdoor space that is ideal for entertaining, relaxing or enjoying the afternoon and evening sun.\r\n\r\nThe location is difficult to beat. Loreto Avenue is a mature, established residential setting within easy reach of Rathfarnham Village and just minutes from Nutgrove Shopping Centre. An excellent selection of primary and secondary schools, crèches, shops, cafés, restaurants, parks and recreational amenities are all within close proximity.\r\n\r\nThe property also enjoys excellent access to the wider Dublin area, with the M50 approximately 10 minutes away and a variety of transport links close at hand.\r\n\r\nSet on a quiet residential road with a strong owner-occupier presence, this property offers an excellent combination of privacy, convenience and comfortable living in one of Rathfarnham’s most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nWith its excellent condition, bright and spacious accommodation, private south-facing garden and highly versatile two-room cabin, this is a home with a great deal to offer and really needs to be viewed to be fully appreciated.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nTo arrange an immediate viewing, please apply online with your name, telephone number and email address and we will get straight back to you.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, should you have any questions or wish to discuss the property further, please contact Conerney Estate Agents on 01 492 6004."
      },
